{"product_id":"the-blood-sugar-solution-10-day-detox-diet-cookbook-more-than-150-recipes-to-help-you-lose-weight-and-stay-healthy-for-life-the-dr-hyman-library-4","title":"The Blood Sugar Solution 10-Day Detox Diet Cookbook: More than 150 Recipes to Help You Lose Weight and Stay Healthy for Life (The Dr. Hyman Library, 4)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe companion cookbook to Dr. Mark Hyman's revolutionary weight-loss program, the #1 New York Times bestseller The Blood Sugar Solution 10-Day Detox Diet, with more than 150 recipes for immediate results.Dr. Hyman's bestselling The Blood Sugar Solution 10-Day Detox Diet offered readers a step-by-step guide for losing weight and reversing disease. Now Dr. Hyman shares more than 150 delicious recipes that support the 10-Day Detox Diet, so you can continue on your path to good health.With easy-to-prepare, delicious recipes for every meal -- including breakfast smoothies, lunches like Waldorf Salad with Smoked Paprika, and Grass-Fed Beef Bolognese for dinner -- you can achieve fast and sustained weight loss by activating your natural ability to burn fat, reducing insulin levels and inflammation, reprogramming your metabolism, shutting off your fat-storing genes, creating effortless appetite control, and soothing stress. Your health is a lifelong journey. The Blood Sugar Solution 10-Day Detox Diet Cookbook helps make that journey both do-able and delicious.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 203 x 241\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mark Hyman\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780316338813\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45481539207321,"sku":"10RF9780316338813","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6852c78d3c59a-The-Blood-Sugar-Solution-10-Day-Detox-Diet-Cookbook-More-than-150-Recipes-to-Help-_4389_1.jpg?v=1753121383","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.co